  {
    "id": "ghost-farewell-context",
    "source": "<b>Ghost:</b> <indent=16%><i>If this is the future you desire, choose it with intent, Ophelia.</i>\n<i>Do not shy away from the world, as I did. Go into the darkness with strength. Go with purpose.</i>\n<i>That is all.</i></indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>...\nThank you, everyone.",
    "target": "<b>幽灵:</b> <indent=16%><i>如果这就是你想要的未来，奥菲莉娅，那就明确地选择它。</i>\n<i>不要像我那样逃避世界。带着力量向黑暗中前行。带着目标前行。</i>\n<i>我要说的就是这些。</i></indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>...\n谢谢大家。",
    "source_sha256": "b5fb6e68844825be86ebaeb84dce8836632dcdb633ae130cc42c0b58da5c9b13",
